ion with him is not  so obvious while lucifer himself isn't  too concerned about playing hooky from  running hell the natural order has been  upended so obviously there's some  tension but lucifer is still able to  contact his siblings whenever he wishes  opening up a channel of celestial  communication by praying to a particular  sibling with that said his closest  connection remains with amenadil he  regularly uses this ability to contact  him even when his big brother is  patrolling hell to cover for him lucifer  can also modify this ability to  communicate with the spirits of the dead  and he uses it to conveniently discover  details at crime scenes however unlike  his ability to tap into the celestial  communication highway his powers to  communicate with human spirits are more  limited  so you had a conversation with a dead  guy oh no he wasn't quite dead his soul  hadn't crossed the threshold  but as the king of hell he has some  demonic powers to balance out the  angelic  sure lucifer may have some angelic  powers and is actually a good guy at  heart but make no mistake he's still  well satan he hasn't been the great  tempter for millennia for nothing and  for lucifer his favorite form of  temptation is carnal it's hard to deny  he oozes sex appeal and he uses his  heightened sexuality to tempt and arouse  people naturally he often employs it to  his advantage when making a deal or  trying to ferret information out of  someone he's an equal opportunity  tempter though he mostly uses his powers  on women but he's just as happy to  seduce men when he feels like it he has  discovered an exceptionally small list  of people who are immune to a sexual  allure just chloe decker and her  ex-husband dan played by kevin alejandro  though lucifer has never attempted to  seduce dan thanks to their endless  rivalry the fact that lucifer's closest  friends aren't overwhelmed by his power  seems to suggest that the closer he is  with someone the more his power lessens  this could however also be loose for  subconsciously tamping it down as he  doesn't want to manipulate those he  genuinely respects and cares about but  what he may restrain around his friends  he unleashes on others  what do you desire tell me and it's  yours  this is the line lucifer fans have grown  familiar with he says it virtually every  episode of all his powers desire  exhibition is his most useful tool when  it comes to getting information out of  suspects or witnesses  with this power he is able to draw  someone's deepest desires and wishes out  of them and get them to verbalize them  aloud it's not quite mind control  lucifer doesn't take over their mind and  force it out of them but it operates  more like hypnosis with only chloe  managing to stay immune when lucifer  turns up the intensity he can draw out  shameful secrets dark sins or unpleasant  truths though it's rare that he pushes  hard to obtain this information lucifer  must maintain eye contact in order for  this power to work and once it's broken  so is his spell interestingly when he  was slowly turning into his full demon  form the power grew stronger and he no  longer needed eye contact to accomplish  it this lends credence to the idea that  when he's more human he subconsciously  holds himself back from prying into  someone's innermost secrets even though  he says of himself in the episode our  mojo i am and always will be master of  the mojo king of desire sultan of humans  in the most wishes and indeed he is but  more than just a king of desire he's  also the king of hell  lucifer may spend 99 of his time on  earth but despite the fact that he's  grown bored and miserable ruling over  health he's still lord of all demons and  that won't change even after years away  from hell lucifer still maintains total  control over the infernal realm in  season 4 when mid-level demons break  free of hell and infest earth in a coup  against lucifer they see his handsome  human face and perfectly tailored 